{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49413","headline":"山花子 一 · 和凝","name":"山花子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莺锦蝉縠馥麝脐，轻裾花草晓烟迷。\n鸂鶒战金红掌坠，翠云低。\n星靥笑偎霞脸畔，蹙金开襜衬银泥。\n春思半和芳草嫩，碧萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}